@startuml
!include includes/style.puml
allow_mixing

title 技能组合切片 · 一个技能如何穿过各层
caption 以 plan_week_menu 为例；其他技能形状相同，只是依赖不同。

left to right direction
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 36

actor "家庭成员" as User
component "吃饭助手\n入口 / 上下文 / 工具白名单" as Assistant <<entry>>

package "L4 · 生活技能" as SkillLayer {
  component "plan_week_menu\n周菜单草稿" as Skill <<agent>>
}

package "L3 · 领域服务" as Domain {
  component "recipe\n菜谱库" as Recipe <<service>>
  component "meal_plan\n周菜单/记录" as MealPlan <<service>>
}

package "L2 · 原子能力" as Caps {
  component "rules\n忌口 / 重复 / 时间" as Rules <<capability>>
  component "llm\n偏好收窄 / 解释" as LLM <<capability>>
}

package "确认边界" as Actions {
  database "assistant_action\nproposed → confirmed\n→ executed / expired" as Action <<agent>>
  component "core API\n唯一业务写入口" as Core <<service>>
}

User --> Assistant : “下周吃什么？”
Assistant --> Skill : 选择技能
Skill --> Recipe : 读菜谱
Skill --> MealPlan : 读最近记录
Skill --> Rules : 规则过滤
Skill -.-> LLM : 可选解释
Skill --> Action : 创建 proposed
Action --> Core : 确认后执行
Core --> MealPlan : confirm_week

note bottom of Action
  **人确认前不写业务真相**
  技能只产生草稿；
  confirmed 才调用 core API；
  同一 action 最多执行一次。
end note

note bottom of SkillLayer
  **技能不拥有表**
  技能只组合 public service；
  领域服务拥有表与事务。
end note

note right of Domain
  **其他助手/技能的形状**
  capture_inventory = perception + inventory（库存助手）
  plan_week_menu   = recipe + meal_plan + rules（吃饭助手）
  replenish        = meal_plan + shopping + inventory（采购助手）
  remind           = task + scheduler + notify（提醒助手）
end note

legend right
  |= 颜色 |= 含义 |
  | <color:#DCFCE7>■</color> | 助手 / 技能 |
  | <color:#DBEAFE>■</color> | 领域服务 |
  | <color:#CCFBF1>■</color> | 原子能力 |
  | <color:#FEF3C7>■</color> | 待确认 / 数据 |
endlegend

@enduml
